From a591386372ff9d00597b6cb36d623436ece0433e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Basanagouda Nagappa Koppad <basanagouda.nagappa.koppad@intel.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 02:21:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] xe: Honor nocompression for LNL CCS

vendor.minigbm.debug=nocompression only drops
I915_FORMAT_MOD_Y_TILED_CCS. On Xe2/Xe3 (LNL, PTL, WCL) the backend
picks I915_FORMAT_MOD_4_TILED_LNL_CCS, so compression could not be
turned off at runtime.

When compression is disabled, fall back to an uncompressed modifier
the caller allows: I915_FORMAT_MOD_4_TILED without a modifier list, or
the first of 4-tiled and linear present in the list. If the list holds
neither, the allocation fails rather than returning a buffer with a
modifier the caller did not ask for. Compression stays enabled by
default.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1589
Signed-off-by: Basanagouda Nagappa Koppad <basanagouda.nagappa.koppad@intel.com>
---
 xe.c | 14 ++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+)

diff --git a/xe.c b/xe.c
index 03c019a..dc913de 100644
--- a/xe.c
+++ b/xe.c
@@ -596,6 +596,20 @@ static int xe_bo_compute_metadata(struct bo *bo, uint32_t width, uint32_t height
 			modifier = I915_FORMAT_MOD_Y_TILED;
 	}
 
+	/*
+	 * Skip I915_FORMAT_MOD_4_TILED_LNL_CCS modifier if compression is disabled.
+	 * Without a modifier list use 4 tiled. With a list, only fall back to a
+	 * modifier the caller allows (4 tiled, then linear), otherwise fail.
+	 */
+	if (!bo->drv->compression && modifier == I915_FORMAT_MOD_4_TILED_LNL_CCS) {
+		if (!modifiers || drv_has_modifier(modifiers, count, I915_FORMAT_MOD_4_TILED))
+			modifier = I915_FORMAT_MOD_4_TILED;
+		else if (drv_has_modifier(modifiers, count, DRM_FORMAT_MOD_LINEAR))
+			modifier = DRM_FORMAT_MOD_LINEAR;
+		else
+			return -EINVAL;
+	}
+
 	switch (modifier) {
 	case DRM_FORMAT_MOD_LINEAR:
 		bo->meta.tiling = XE_TILING_NONE;
-- 
